# Oga Sunny Radio — music files

Drop the mp3 files inside `public/music/` with these exact names:

| Song                    | File path                               |
| ----------------------- | --------------------------------------- |
| OORGANIC No Be Mechanic | `public/music/oorganic-no-be-mechanic.mp3` |
| Mararaba at Night       | `public/music/mararaba-at-night.mp3`       |
| Fine Fine Girls         | `public/music/fine-fine-girls.mp3`         |

Track titles, artist and lyrics live in `src/data/tracks.ts`.
